AT Protocol Spaces lexicons (the permissioned-data alpha), copied unmodified
from the reference implementation:

  repo:   https://github.com/bluesky-social/atproto
  branch: permissioned-data-alpha (PR #5187; the published Nov 24 alpha)
  commit: 1f510f8e36a973f6fd055da349b586918805ae66
          (the four directories are unchanged since 16bfeba7, the Nov 13 alpha:
          the Nov 24 alpha changes no space lexicon's shape, only the URI form
          their `space-ref` and `at-uri` values carry)
  paths:  lexicons/com/atproto/space/*.json          (methods, defs, the policy record)
          lexicons/com/atproto/memberspace/*.json    (policy, member record, member methods, defs)
          lexicons/com/atproto/managedspace/*.json   (policy, checkAccess)
          lexicons/com/atproto/personalspace/*.json  (policy)

License: MIT (bluesky-social/atproto). Upstream changes weekly; to update,
copy the four directories from a newer commit, update this file, and re-bundle
(lexicons/bundle.py, usage at its top). The rest of lexicons/bundle.json comes
from the upstream main branch's lexicons and is bundled on its own schedule:
when re-bundling Spaces alone, replace only the com.atproto.{space,memberspace,
managedspace,personalspace}.* entries.
